<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong stock market is closed on Monday for a public holiday. Trade will resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, the blue-chip Hang Seng index fell 54.13 points or 0.47 percent to 11,424.64, and the London Reference index later declined a further 30.97 points to 11,393.67.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
